  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Using the provided information in the following paper chromatogram:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0282_de924b80c19e.png\" style=\"width: 422px; height: 301px;\" /></p><p>The calculated <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math> value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>_____</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Distance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>travelled</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>by</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>compound</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Distance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>travelled</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>by</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solvent</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>On chromatogram distance travelled by compound is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Distance travelled by solvent<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
